      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你看见格雷格。",
      "source_text": "你看见格雷格。",
      "source_line_start": 7,
      "source_line_end": 7,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 7,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "What?  Why are you talking to me? They'll hear you know.",
      "source_text": "What?  Why are you talking to me? They'll hear you know.",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 8,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "什么？你为什么和我说话？你知道他们会听到的。",
      "source_text": "什么？你为什么和我说话？你知道他们会听到的。",
      "source_line_start": 9,
      "source_line_end": 9,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Hi, your back.  Don't talk so loud, they're out there.",
      "source_text": "Hi, your back.  Don't talk so loud, they're out there.",
      "source_line_start": 10,
      "source_line_end": 10,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "嗨，你回来了。别大声说话，他们在外面。",
      "source_text": "嗨，你回来了。别大声说话，他们在外面。",
      "source_line_start": 11,
      "source_line_end": 11,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 11,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Ok, but keep it down, they'll come for both of us if you don't stop shouting.",
      "source_text": "Ok, but keep it down, they'll come for both of us if you don't stop shouting.",
      "source_line_start": 12,
      "source_line_end": 12,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 12,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "好吧，但是小点声，如果你继续叫，他们会过来对付我们两个。",
      "source_text": "好吧，但是小点声，如果你继续叫，他们会过来对付我们两个。",
      "source_line_start": 13,
      "source_line_end": 13,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 13,
