    {
      "occurrence": 29,
      "number": 113,
      "number_raw": "113",
      "source_number": "113",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Well they are...You know don't you...The disease was just the start.  Now they're going to come and take as all.  But you are just like all the rest.  You won't believe me, and you'll be doomed.  You mark my words.   I'LL STILL BE HERE, and ALL OF THIS, INCLUDING YOU, WILL BE TAKEN.  TAKEN. 【Greg grasps his head and curls up in a ball, squealing and thrashing about】",
      "source_text": "Well they are...You know don't you...The disease was just the start.  Now they're going to come and take as all.  But you are just like all the rest.  You won't believe me, and you'll be doomed.  You mark my words.   I'LL STILL BE HERE, and ALL OF THIS, INCLUDING YOU, WILL BE TAKEN.  TAKEN. 【Greg grasps his head and curls up in a ball, squealing and thrashing about】",
