      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Medication...Oh so you're one of them, trying to get me to take my medication again....Well you won't get me to.  I WON'T TAKE IT, NO, I WON'T.  THE VOICES, NO I WON'T, YOU CAN'T MAKE ME. 【Greg close his eyes shut and clutches his head frantically, talking with the voices that only he can hear.】",
      "source_text": "Medication...Oh so you're one of them, trying to get me to take my medication again....Well you won't get me to.  I WON'T TAKE IT, NO, I WON'T.  THE VOICES, NO I WON'T, YOU CAN'T MAKE ME. 【Greg close his eyes shut and clutches his head frantically, talking with the voices that only he can hear.】",
